00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.820
What does the transpose do?

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:26.320
Let's suppose x is a matrix,

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:27.680
like 1,

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:29.000
4, 7,

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.760
