00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:51.080
columns of x into the rows of x
transpose.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:54.420
So x here is two rows by three
columns,

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:57.020
x transpose is going to be three
by two.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:59.600
Its first column will be x's
first row,

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:00.500
147,

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:04.180
and its second column will be
x's So this is second row,

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:06.430
2, 1, 9.

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.380
Sound familiar?

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.040
OK, good.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.140
Now,

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:19.680
this is not directly like this
fact here.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:23.900
It's not directly related to the
