00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:28.360
Let me define two vectors, for
example,

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:31.360
1, 2, 3, 4.

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:38.220
and v being negative 9 1 4 7.

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:42.860
The dot product of u with v,

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:45.280
there's nothing new about that.

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:49.880
But there is another equivalent
way of thinking about it in

