00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:57.530
What was that?

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:02.030
What was that?

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:07.170
Transpose of the second one,

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:08.160
I guess,

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:11.660
like u times by the transpose of
v.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:12.560
Was it the opposite?

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:15.300
Oh, transpose of u l times by v.
Good.

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:17.940
So remember, you can think of a
matrix, or sorry, you can think

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.100
of a vector

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:21.760
as being an n by 1 matrix.

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:25.080
So u is 4 by 1 and v is 4 by 1.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:29.140
You can't do regular matrix
multiplication with u and v.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:34.140
This is not a defined operation.

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:35.760
Why is this not defined?

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:37.280
u times v is just the way I've
